export default "import { Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\n\n<Meta title=\"Docs/Product Package\" />\n\n# Raibach Design System Lifecycle Management\n\n> *\"Assemble. Evaluate. Govern.\"*\n\n**Document of Record** — Built by Raibach · DeepSeek V4 Pro · 2026-07-14 · v0.4.0-alpha\n\n---\n\n## What It Is\n\nA central hub for design system governance — a three-column AI workspace where designers, engineers, and UX leads assemble, test, evaluate, and govern design patterns at enterprise scale.\n\nThe AI is the **surface controller**: it builds prompts, evaluates output against grounding metrics, switches context autonomously, and iterates until quality thresholds are met. Every action is versioned, traced, and auditable.\n\n**Assemble → Evaluate → Govern.**\n\n---\n\n## Who It's For\n\n| Audience | Use Case |\n|----------|----------|\n| **Design system teams** | Manage component libraries across product surfaces |\n| **UX oversight leads** | Audit pattern adherence and drift across teams |\n| **Design engineers** | Bridge Figma designs to production code through AI-assisted pipelines |\n| **Enterprise governance** | Audit trails, role-based access, quality gates on design output |\n| **Product teams** | Ideate, inspect, and manipulate design system elements without designer intermediaries |\n| **Executives** | Generate production-ready presentations and reports from the same design system |\n\n---\n\n## Features\n\n| Feature | Phase | Status | Detail |\n|---------|-------|--------|--------|\n| A2UI Control Surface | 1–4 | 🔄 In Progress | Session-scoped chat, AI control tags, element IDs, autonomous loop |\n| Save Pipeline | 1–2 | ✅ Complete | compiled_output persistence, API-first conversations, localStorage purged |\n| Figma Make Pipeline | 1–3 | ⚠️ Manual | Design-to-code extraction, automation planned |\n| Milvus Versioning | — | ✅ Done | Auto-snapshot on every RUN, semantic search across history |\n| Grounding Metrics | — | ✅ Done | Faithfulness, hallucination, recall, relevance, completeness |\n| Sentry Monitoring | — | ✅ Done | Error boundaries, API tracking, performance profiling, conversation audit |\n\n---\n\n## Architecture\n\nThree-column agentic IDE — the AI is the surface controller, not a chatbot bolted to the sidebar.\n\n| Column | Role | Components |\n|--------|------|------------|\n| **Left** | Prompt Builder | System Role, User Role, Tool Call, Few Shot, Context, Constraints, Custom Roles |\n| **Third** | Output Workspace | Streaming output, model selector, editable text, save/export/regenerate |\n| **Right** | AI Assistant + Audit | Chat (session-scoped), Trace (Milvus versions), Variables (token detection) |\n\n**Dual database:** PostgreSQL (sessions, versions, conversations) + Milvus Lite (semantic snapshots, vector search)\n\n---\n\n## Development Pipeline\n\n```\nFigma Design → FIGMA_MAKE_PIPELINE → frontend/src/components/\n                                     ↓\nUser builds prompt → SAVE_PIPELINE → PostgreSQL + Milvus\n                                     ↓\nAI controls surface → A2UI_CONTROL_SURFACE → three-column workspace\n```\n\n---\n\n## Deep Dives\n\n| Document | Content |\n|----------|---------|\n| [Project Overview](./iframe.html?id=docs-storybook-project-overview--docs) | Landing page — curation rules, A2UI story, full feature status |\n| [A2UI Control Surface](./iframe.html?id=docs-a2ui-control-surface--docs) | Four-phase plan: session chat → control tags → element IDs → autonomous loop |\n| [Architecture Vision](./iframe.html?id=docs-architecture-vision--docs) | The Dynamic Semantic Canvas — one surface, infinite workflows |\n| [Save Pipeline](./iframe.html?id=docs-save-pipeline--docs) | Session persistence: all three columns atomic |\n| [Figma Make Pipeline](./iframe.html?id=docs-figma-make-pipeline--docs) | Design-to-code: Figma export → flat components |\n| [Roadmap](./iframe.html?id=docs-roadmap--docs) | Now → Next → Later → Future |\n\n---\n\n## Technology Stack\n\n| Layer | Technology |\n|-------|-----------|\n| Frontend | React 19, Vite 7, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS 4, shadcn/ui |\n| Backend | FastAPI (Python 3.14), Uvicorn, PostgreSQL, Milvus Lite |\n| Design-to-Code | Figma Make → custom transform pipeline |\n| Monitoring | Sentry (error boundaries, API tracking, performance profiling) |\n| Deployment | GitHub Actions CI/CD → SiteGround (Apache reverse proxy, PHP proxy) |\n| Component Docs | Storybook 8 with Chromatic, a11y, interactive testing |\n\n---\n\n## Live Deployment\n\n| Environment | URL |\n|-------------|-----|\n| Production | [prompt-portal-prod.raibach.net](https://prompt-portal-prod.raibach.net/) |\n| Storybook | [prompt-portal-prod.raibach.net/storybook/](https://prompt-portal-prod.raibach.net/storybook/) |\n| GitHub | [github.com/Raibach/prompt-composer-console](https://github.com/Raibach/prompt-composer-console) |\n\n"